=== layout: two-panels

# A logo should help me find your company

@right

![Cover logo and tagline](assets/business_plan_samples/linkaments_logo.png)

@left

## A few useful choices

- Readable name at a small size.
- One consistent color and type style.
- Enough contrast on screen and on paper.
- Reuse the identity; give the explanation room.

@notes

The interlocking graphic connects the name to the product idea. Use it as a visual-identity example, not proof of a working implant.
Current rubric and Blackboard determine requirements; do not promise the old unconfirmed logo bonus.
Source screenshot: 2017-Linkaments_Executive_Summary.pdf, PDF page 1; asset linkaments_logo.png.
